  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling the time",
     "texto": [
      "The question is **Che ore sono?** (or **Che ora è?**).",
      "You answer in the plural, with the feminine article: **Sono le nove** (it's nine o'clock). Only one o'clock takes the singular: **È l'una**.",
      "**E un quarto** = quarter past. **E mezza** = half past. **Meno un quarto** = quarter to.",
      "Twelve o'clock: **mezzogiorno** (midday) and **mezzanotte** (midnight), with «è»: **È mezzogiorno**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Time",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Clock",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Se dice",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "9:00",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Sono le nove.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
