        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At what time",
     "texto": [
      "**A che ora?** = at what time? You answer with **alle**: **alle otto**. With one o'clock, **all'una**.",
      "**Sono in ritardo** = I'm late. **Adesso** = now.",
      "Some **-ire** verbs, like **finire**, add **-isc-** in several forms: **finisco, finisci, finisce, finiscono**. Not all **-ire** verbs do: **partire → parto**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
